#: ../../technical/articles/195-worked-example-reference-oracles.md:10
msgid "Scope and inventory"
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/195-worked-example-reference-oracles.md:12
msgid ""
"This chunk contains 22 small JSON files totaling 56,425 bytes. I parsed "
"every file's structure for inventory counts and sampled scenario notes, "
"input locators, and expected outputs across the main model families. The "
"inventory is strongly IRPF-weighted: 13 Modelo 100 cases across 2020, "
"2021, 2022, and 2024; two Modelo 303 cases; two Modelo 322 cases; and one"
" each for IVA place-of-supply, Modelo 200, Modelo 202, Modelo 353, and "
"Modelo 390. In total, the files describe 85 expected values keyed to "
"casillas or categorical outcomes. Twelve cases include declared input "
"maps; most expected values are string-encoded decimal amounts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/195-worked-example-reference-oracles.md:14
msgid ""
"The corpus is a reference-oracle layer: entries identify a worked AEAT "
"manual or other source, often with page/line locators, scenario notes, "
"declared inputs, and expected casilla values. It can support "
"regression/evaluation comparisons and make the evidence behind a case "
"inspectable. It does not itself calculate a return, validate a case, or "
"establish that a locator, interpretation, or output is correct. The notes"
" in some fixtures describe linked tests and formula chains, but those "
"claims were not executed or independently checked in this static pass."
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/195-worked-example-reference-oracles.md:16
msgid "Sampled scenario coverage"
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/195-worked-example-reference-oracles.md:18
msgid ""
"The sampled IVA place-of-supply example is deliberately not a casilla "
"fixture: it records a categorical Spanish mainland-to-France B2B goods "
"scenario, a location conclusion, an intra-community supply category, and "
"two legal-reference fields. The filename and note explicitly separate it "
"from the model/casilla oracle loader. This distinction is useful because "
"it separates transaction classification evidence from calculated return "
"amounts. See the place-of-supply example "
"(`src/cadrumo/_data/corpus/manual_oracles/iva-2025-lugar-realizacion-"
"entrega-intracomunitaria.json`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/195-worked-example-reference-oracles.md:20
msgid ""
"The Modelo 100 cases cover income from professional activity, employment-"
"dismissal treatment, regional and family-minimum examples, property "
"income, and capital gains. In one sampled 2024 simplified-direct-"
"estimation case, `declared_inputs.by_casilla_id` and per-casilla evidence"
" locators are mapped separately from the expected totals (casillas 0180 "
"and 0226). A separate Asturias descendant-minimum example expects "
"0513/0514 at 4,550 each and its note explicitly excludes an unrelated "
"extracted-table discrepancy. These are helpful controls for source-"
"grounded test data, but the scenario coverage is not a complete "
"representation of IRPF fact patterns or regions. See the 2024 activity "
"example (`src/cadrumo/_data/corpus/manual_oracles/modelo-100-2024"
"-estimacion-directa-simplificada.json`) and descendant-minimum example "
"(`src/cadrumo/_data/corpus/manual_oracles/modelo-100-2024-minimo-"
"descendientes-prorrateo-asturias.json`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/195-worked-example-reference-oracles.md:22
msgid ""
"The sampled corporate-tax case links its source to a 2024 Sociedad manual"
" and names the minimum-taxation example; the 2025 Modelo 202 question is "
"sourced to the manual's installment-payment example. On IVA, the 2024 "
"Modelo 303 oracle covers a combination of general regime, equivalence "
"surcharge, intra-community acquisition and importation, while the 2025 "
"prorrata case separates supplied annual-volume inputs from a computed "
"percentage expectation. Those distinctions help a test harness avoid "
"grading manual inputs as though they were outputs. See Modelo 200 "
"(`src/cadrumo/_data/corpus/manual_oracles/modelo-200-2024-ejemplo1"
"-tributacion-minima-empresa-grande.json`), Modelo 202 "
"(`src/cadrumo/_data/corpus/manual_oracles/modelo-202-2025-primer-pago-"
"modalidad-40-2.json`), Modelo 303 general regime "
"(`src/cadrumo/_data/corpus/manual_oracles/modelo-303-2024-regimen-"
"general-recargo-intracomunitaria-importacion.json`), and Modelo 303 "
"prorrata (`src/cadrumo/_data/corpus/manual_oracles/modelo-303-2025"
"-prorrata-general-regularizacion.json`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/195-worked-example-reference-oracles.md:24
msgid ""
"The group and annual IVA samples form a connected story: one Modelo 322 "
"example is for the dominant entity, another is the dependent entity; the "
"353 fixture records a group aggregate; and the 390 fixture grounds annual"
" totals in four 2024 quarterly totals. This is a useful but narrow slice "
"of the cross-model relationships. It should not be generalized to all "
"member roster configurations, periods, or registry revisions. See Modelo "
"322 dominant entity "
"(`src/cadrumo/_data/corpus/manual_oracles/modelo-322-2024-grupo-"
"entidades-omega.json`), Modelo 322 dependent entity "
"(`src/cadrumo/_data/corpus/manual_oracles/modelo-322-2024-grupo-"
"entidades-delta.json`), Modelo 353 aggregate "
"(`src/cadrumo/_data/corpus/manual_oracles/modelo-353-2024-grupo-"
"entidades-agregado.json`), and Modelo 390 annual summary "
"(`src/cadrumo/_data/corpus/manual_oracles/modelo-390-2024-resumen-anual-"
"cuatro-trimestres.json`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/195-worked-example-reference-oracles.md:26
msgid "Quality, trust, and limitations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/195-worked-example-reference-oracles.md:28
msgid ""
"The explicit distinction between source locators, declared inputs, and "
"expected outputs is a good test-data design choice. Verbose notes "
"sometimes describe what was intentionally excluded or how an example was "
"chosen; those notes are themselves data and are not an independent legal "
"review. The strongest coverage gap is distribution: Modelo 100 has 13 "
"scenarios while every other model has one or two. Most fixtures represent"
" historical years, and the group examples use one illustrative group. "
"Treat them as regression anchors for those cited worked examples, not as "
"current filing instructions or a broad legal oracle."
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/195-worked-example-reference-oracles.md:30
msgid ""
"The JSON is declarative and contains no execution logic. No credentials "
"or taxpayer records are evident; some worked examples use illustrative "
"persons/entities and amounts. Security risk is low for static "
"consumption, though consumers should still validate untrusted/modified "
"JSON against a schema before using expected values in automated gates. No"
" application was run and no code was changed."
msgstr ""

